# What the image build (infra/docker/Dockerfile) never needs: installed packages, build output, local secrets, the domain
# source material (never published), and the repository's history.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-e2e
**/dist
**/out
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.local
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
# a test installation's certificates and keys (tools/prod-stack.mjs): never in an image or its build cache
infra/compose/tls
infra/compose/backup-tls
infra/compose/files-tls
infra/compose/drill-reports
Documents
docs
